`event` / `service` / `tool` / `middleware` 互相依赖 | 禁止（彼此不依赖） |","table":"table-0"},"141":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-17","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#crate-依赖方向","content":"| 边                                   | 允许吗       |\n| ----------------------------------- | --------- |\n| `fuyubot-tdlib-sys` → 任何 fuyu crate | 禁止（它是最底层） |","table":"table-0"},"142":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-18","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#crate-依赖方向","content":"| 边                                                  | 允许吗         |\n| -------------------------------------------------- | ----------- |\n| `fuyubot-loader` → 四个机制 + `tdlib` + `abi` + `core` | 允许（**只有它**） |","table":"table-0"},"143":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-19","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#crate-依赖方向","content":"组合只发生在两处：`HostRuntime::new`（把四个机制 `install` 进 `Context`）与 `HostRuntime` 里的\n20 个 `unsafe extern \"C\"` 桥（VTable 的 20 个函数指针各对应一个）。四个机制 crate 绝不彼此调用。"},"144":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-20","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#启动顺序先-attach-tdlib再-load-插件","content":"启动顺序：attach TDLib 必须在 load 插件之前"},"145":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-21","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#启动顺序先-attach-tdlib再-load-插件","content":"五步线性流程：建内核 → 建 loader（装四个机制）→ attach TDLib → dlopen 插件 → 起分发循环。第三步是关键顺序点，做晚了插件发请求就会走「没接 TDLib」分支。"},"146":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-22","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#启动顺序先-attach-tdlib再-load-插件","content":"1"},"147":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-23","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#启动顺序先-attach-tdlib再-load-插件","content":"Kernel::new() → kernel.start()"},"148":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-24","page_id":"/docs/