table":"table-0"},"1403":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-49","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#薄-sdk-能干什么","content":"| 函数      | 干什么                  |\n| ------- | -------------------- |\n| `run()` | 握手并开始收事件。**永远放最后一行** |","table":"table-0"},"1404":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-50","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#薄-sdk-能干什么","content":"`on` 收到的 `payload` 是解析好的对象 / 字典，直接取字段就行，不用自己拼 JSON。\n更多事件名与接口用法见按语言的页面："},"1405":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-51","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#薄-sdk-能干什么","content":"<Card title=\"Python 插件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/python/\" />"},"1406":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-52","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#薄-sdk-能干什么","content":"<Card title=\"JS 与 TypeScript 插件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/js-ts/\" />"},"1407":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-53","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#薄-sdk-能干什么","content":"<Card title=\"订阅与事件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/events/\" />"},"1408":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-54","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#装好之后会发生什么","content":"| 你做的                           | 机器人的反应                                  |\n| ----------------------------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot plugin install <目录>` | 目录整个拷进 `plugins/scripts/`，下次 `run` 自动加载 |","table":"table-1"},"1409":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-55","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#装好之后会发生什么","content":"| 你做的                            | 机器人的反应          |\n| ------------------------------ | --------------- |\n| 运行中往 `plugins/scripts/` 丢一个新目录 | 约一秒内自动发现、装依赖、启动 |","table":"table-1"},"1410":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-56","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#装好之后会发生什么","content":"| 你做的         | 机器人的反应              |\n| ----------- | ------------------- |\n| 运行中删掉一个脚本目录 | 自动停掉对应脚本（对跑着的实例也安全） |","table":"table-1"},"1411":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-57","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#装好之后会发生什么","content":"| 你做的      | 机器人的反应              |\n| -------- | ------------------- |\n| 改了脚本里的代码 | **不**自动重启；改完重启机器人即可 |","table":"table-1"},"1412":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-58","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#装好之后会发生什么","content":"| 你做的                              | 机器人的反应    |\n| -------------------------------- | --------- |\n| `fuyubot plugin uninstall <目录名>` | 删掉目录并卸载脚本 |","table":"table-1"},"1413":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-59","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#装好之后会发生什么","content":"**名字的两副面孔**：manifest 里的 `name`（如 `mybot.my-plugin`）是插件身份，日志里看到的是它；\n`plugin uninstall` 用的是**目录名**（`my-plugin`）。装的时候整个目录一起拷，\n`node_modules` / `.venv` / `target` 这类依赖与构建产物会被跳过——到机器人上现装。"},"1414":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-60","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#两种形态怎么选","content":"|     | 脚本插件（本页）            | 原生插件                   |\n| --- | ------------------- | ---------------------- |\n| 写什么 | Python / JS / TS 脚本 | Rust / C / C++ 编译出的动态库 |","table":"table-2"},"1415":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-61","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#两种形态怎么选","content":"|      | 脚本插件（本页） | 原生插件        |\n| ---- | -------- | ----------- |\n| 要编译吗 | 不要       | 要（用你自己的工具链） |","table":"table-2"},"1416":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-62","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#两种形态怎么选","content":"|       | 脚本插件（本页）          | 原生插件     |\n| ----- | ----------------- | -------- |\n| 崩了会怎样 | 只有这个脚本的进程死，机器人照常跑 | 可能拖垮整个宿主 |","table":"table-2"},"1417":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-63","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#两种形态怎么选","content":"|     | 脚本插件（本页）      | 原生插件         |\n| --- | ------------- | ------------ |\n| 适合  | 机器人逻辑、自动化、小工具 | 高性能、要贴近宿主的场合 |","table":"table-2"},"1418":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-64","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#两种形态怎么选","content":"原生插件是「一个 cdylib 一个插件」，见 插件总览。"},"1419":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-65","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#常见问题","content":"**脚本报「找不到 fuyubot 原生桥库」**：脚本进程要加载 `fuyubot_sdk_native`\n（和托管插件是同一份库）。把它放在插件目录里，或设环境变量\n`FUYUBOT_NATIVE_LIB` 指向它的完整路径，再重启机器人。"},"1420":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-66","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#常见问题","content":"**依赖工具**：Python 要装 uv，JS / TS 要装\nbun。缺了的话对应脚本起不来，日志里会有提示，但不影响机器人启动。"},"1421":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-67","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#常见问题","content":"**托管插件**：`plugins/` 里要有 `fuyubot_python_host` / `fuyubot_js_host`\n两个中间插件（脚本由它们托管），和内置插件放在一起。"},"1422":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-68","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#常见问题","content":"**插件名只允许**字母、数字和 `.` `_` `-`。"},"1423":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-69","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#常见问题","content":"**想排查脚本**：把配置里 `[plugins].log_level` 调成 `\"debug\"`（见\n配置文件），日志会详细很多。"},"1424":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"page","content":"Simplify 封装","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify"},"1425":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify","content":"fuyubot-simplify 的 API 参考：按功能范围分组的参数结构体、链式设置器与返回值"},"1426":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/